<%- include('partials/header') %>

<section class="faq">
    <h1>Frequently Asked Questions</h1>

    <div class="faq-item">
        <h2>What types of shoes do you accept?</h2>
        <p>We primarily accept gently-used basketball shoes, running shoes, and sneakers. We welcome donations of athletic shoes in all sizes.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
        <h2>How do I donate shoes?</h2>
        <p>You can fill out our donation form on the Donate page to schedule a pickup. We also accept drop-off donations at our West Vancouver location.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
        <h2>Where do the donated shoes go?</h2>
        <p>Your donated shoes are cleaned and distributed to youth in need across Greater Vancouver through schools and community partners.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
        <h2>Can I request shoes for someone?</h2>
        <p>Yes! If you or someone you know needs shoes, please fill out the form on the Get Shoes page and we’ll do our best to match you with a pair.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
        <h2>How can I volunteer?</h2>
        <p>Visit our Volunteer page to sign up. We need help with shoe collection, cleaning, sorting, and distribution events.</p>
    </div>

</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
